title: 'spec-msg: delivery integration tests'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: Test spec-msg delivery, bundles, relay forks and history serving by late nodes.
    Send application XCM in both directions and drain channels closed by either peer.
    Verify delivery across collator restarts and routing across three parachains.
    Check HRMP preference, queued delivery during cutover, and rollback.
